          <msContents>
            <summary>Ein künstliches unnd bewerthes Artzneybuch allen guthertzigen frombenn Schriften beschriben ... Ietzo neulich gemehrt unnd gebessert sambt einem ordentlichen Register durch Joh. B. Alumnum Scholae Laurentianae Noribergensis. 
              The text is dated 1579, 1580, and the MS. has had the Index supplied by-Johann Bröll, son of the compiler. Overall dates of volume 1579-1580 and 1601.</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="de" source="IANA">German</textLang>
